<Layout title="ADHD, asthma, and college-student care in Blacksburg | Kin & Campus" description="Pediatric care in Blacksburg for Virginia Tech students: ADHD and other medication follow-up, asthma, allergies, acne, sexual health, sick visits, and university forms.">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">Our care</div><h1>What we take care of here.</h1><p class="lead">Most students arrive with a plan. We keep it going. We also see the things that show up once they live in a dorm.</p></div>
<div class="w"><img class="photo" src={href("photos/campus-aerial.jpg")} width="800" height="450" alt="Campus and the surrounding hills, seen from above">
<p class="lead" style="margin-top:36px">I see the same list I saw in clinic at home. The difference is they are two hundred miles from the doctor who started it.</p>
<div class="notes">
<div class="note-row" id="adhd"><h3>ADHD</h3><p>If they already have a diagnosis, we can continue the medication. Campus clinics often cannot. Bring the records.</p></div>
<div class="note-row" id="mental-health"><h3>Anxiety and depression medication</h3><p>If they started a prescription at home, we can follow it. If they need a therapist, we help them find one. That part is not us.</p></div>
<div class="note-row" id="asthma"><h3>Asthma and allergies</h3><p>Controllers. Rescue inhalers. Pollen and dining-hall surprises. The plan should last through winter break.</p></div>
<div class="note-row" id="acne"><h3>Acne</h3><p>Common. Treatable. Easy to drop when they are busy. A simple plan they can keep.</p></div>
<div class="note-row" id="forms"><h3>Forms</h3><p>The immunization packet. An SSD housing letter. A sports physical. Travel paperwork.</p></div>
<div class="note-row" id="sexual-health"><h3>Sexual health</h3><p>Contraception. STI testing. Questions they may not want on a parent insurance statement. Their chart. Their choice about who we tell.</p></div>
</div></div>
<section><div class="w split"><svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 360 360" role="img" aria-label="Portrait placeholder"><rect width="360" height="360" rx="28" fill="#EADFCB"/><circle cx="180" cy="140" r="56" fill="#9CAF98"/><path d="M70 330q110-150 220 0z" fill="#6B2737"/><circle cx="270" cy="86" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#C9A24B" stroke-width="8"/></svg>
<div><div class="eyebrow">The physician</div><h2>A pediatrician who lives in Blacksburg.</h2><p class="lead">Board-certified. Eight minutes from campus. They can text when something comes up. If the plan changes, the hometown doctor hears that day.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding-top:0"><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">A year in town</div><h2>August through May.</h2>
<div class="notes">
<div class="note-row"><h3>August</h3><p>A call with you. Then a first visit with them, before classes start.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>The semester</h3><p>Sick visits. Refills. A check-in when they come back from a break.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>Finals</h3><p>Sleep. Stress. Whether they are still taking what we prescribed.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>May</h3><p>A year-end note to the hometown doctor, so next August is not a cold start.</p></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a></p></div></section>
</Layout>
